# Claude Harness - per-repo state, none of it shared
# The plugin writes the three narrow rules below. They are not enough: the rest of
# the tree is a hollow scaffold on this repo (techStack "Unknown", every memory file
# empty since 2026-08-25), so the blanket rule keeps 76 KB of empty JSON out of the
# history. Narrow it if someone ever populates the tree.
.claude-harness/
.claude-harness/sessions/
.claude-harness/memory/compaction-backups/
.claude-harness/memory/working/

# Claude Code - Local settings
.claude/settings.local.json
